  "detail": "The catch path rethrows without clearing `ctx.state.gateExecution`. When the same stage, round and purpose run again (for example after a needs_human answer resumes the run), the stored handle of an execution that already ended in an error is attached instead of a fresh start. Local replays it, but a remote executor would hand back the same failure. Every pending state should end: clear it (and save) when the execution settles, either way."
 },
